# Optional software. One app per line. The base image does not install these.
#
# category | id | label | blurb | kind | target | check
#
# kind:
#   dnf        target is package names
#   dnf-repo   first word is the repo file in repos/<name>.repo, then packages
#   script     target is the vendor installer URL, run as the user
#   github-rpm target is owner/repo/filename-glob from the latest release
#   virt       package names, then libvirtd and the libvirt group
#
# check is the rpm name, or the command the script puts on PATH.
# Add a line. A new category name starts a new section.

Coding agents | codex | Codex | OpenAI's terminal agent. | script | https://chatgpt.com/codex/install.sh | codex
Coding agents | claude | Claude | Anthropic's terminal agent. | dnf-repo | claude-code claude-code | claude-code
Coding agents | antigravity | Antigravity | Google's terminal agent. The IDE has no signed package. | script | https://antigravity.google/cli/install.sh | agy
Coding agents | opencode | OpenCode | Terminal coding agent. | script | https://opencode.ai/v2/install | opencode
Editors | vscode | VS Code | Microsoft's editor. | dnf-repo | vscode code | code
Editors | cursor | Cursor | The other editor. | dnf-repo | cursor cursor | cursor
Communication | rambox | Rambox | Pro is the account you sign into. | github-rpm | ramboxapp/download/Rambox-*-linux-x64.rpm | rambox
Virtual machines | virt | virt-manager and KVM | libvirt, QEMU, and the manager. Log out once so the group applies. | virt | virt-manager qemu-kvm libvirt-daemon-kvm virt-install | virt-manager
Security | duo | Cisco Duo | Duo Unix for SSH. Run `borked duo` after install. | dnf | duo_unix duo_unix-selinux | duo_unix
